# Linuxpi Vulkan qhawariy
app.vulkan.no_loader = schist: kay sistemapi mana Vulkan loader kanchu; chayrayku manam imawanpas siq'iy atikunchu.\n\nSchistqa Vulkanwan rikch'aykunata ruran, ichaqa `libvulkan.so.1` mana churasqachu.\nLoaderpas driverpas iskayninmi kanan:						\n\n    Arch, CachyOS, Omarchy    sudo pacman -S vulkan-icd-loader vulkan-driver\n    Debian, Ubuntu, Mint      sudo apt install libvulkan1 mesa-vulkan-drivers\n    Fedora, RHEL              sudo dnf install vulkan-loader mesa-vulkan-drivers\n
app.vulkan.override_missing = schist: kay sesión mayqin Vulkan driverman rikuchisqanqa manam chaypi kanchu.\n\n{var} churasqam kachkan; chayta churayqa loaderpa driverkunata maskasqanta\nyapananmantaqa rantinman churakun. Chayrayku kay mana kaq archivokunalla\nllapan driver lista kanku; kay sesiónpi llapan Vulkan programaqa\nmay achka churasqa driver kaptinpas manam mayqintapas rikunchu:\n\n{missing}\n    {var}={value}\n\nKaq manifestoman rikuchiy — churasqa driverkuna paykunaqta\n/usr/share/vulkan/icd.d ukhupi churanku — utaq qichuy, loader kikinpa driver\nmaskayninta ruwananpaq. Configuración archivomanta kayta churaq sesiónqa\n(Hyprland `env =`, systemd environment.d drop-in, shell perfil) chaypim\nwillakunan; ruwachkaq imakunaman tikray chayananpaqqa musuqmanta yaykuyta munan.\n
app.vulkan.override_note = \n{var}qa {value} nisqaman churasqam kachkan, chaytaq loaderpa kikin\nmaskayninta rantinman churakun: chay manifestokunamanta mana mayqinpas kay\nmaquinapaq kaptinqa, qichuyqa ñawpaq kallpachakuymi.\n
app.vulkan.no_driver = schist: mana Vulkan driver churasqachu; chayrayku manam imapipas siq'iy atikunchu.\n\nSchistqa Vulkanwan rikch'aykunata ruran. Loader churasqam, ichaqa mana driver\nkasqanta willan; maskasqan iskay k'itimanta mana mayqinmanpas driver qillqakusqachu:\n\n{dirs}\n\nLoaderqa driverkunamanta sapallanmi hamun; chayrayku kayqa aswan achka kuti\nhuk paquete mana kaqllam.\n\nKay maquinap GPU-ninpaq kaqta churay:\n\n    Arch, CachyOS, Omarchy    sudo pacman -S vulkan-driver\n    Debian, Ubuntu, Mint      sudo apt install mesa-vulkan-drivers\n    Fedora, RHEL              sudo dnf install mesa-vulkan-drivers\n\nNVIDIApa sapanchasqa driverninqa kikinpaqmi apamun (Archpi `nvidia-utils`,\nDebianpi `nvidia-driver`). Máquina virtualpi utaq GPU driver mana churana\nmaypipas software rasterizador llamk'anqa: Archpi `vulkan-swrast`, huk\nsistemakunapitaq `mesa-vulkan-drivers`pa huknin. Pisi pisi purinmi, ichaqa qallarinmi.\n{overridden}
app.vulkan.no_device = schist: Vulkan driver churasqam, ichaqa rikch'ay ruranapaq mana dispositivota qunchu.\n\nDriverqa kay GPU-ta mana yanapanmanchu, utaq mana haykuyta atinmanchu; SSH\nukhunta utaq contenedor ukhupiqa /dev/dri mana kaymi sapa kuti rikukun.\n`vulkaninfo --summary` loaderpa rikusqanta willan.\n\nKay maquina mana GPU-yuq kaptinqa software rasterizador mana GPU-wanpas\nrikch'ayta ruran: Archpi `vulkan-swrast`, Debian Fedora ima nisqapitaq\n`mesa-vulkan-drivers`pa huknin.\n
app.vulkan.skip_hint = Schist imayna kasqanpi qallarichinapaq, kikinpa ñanninpi pantananpaq, {var}=1 churay.
